      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mapleview%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village incorporated in 1945 to provide basic services for about one hundred families.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en-academic.com/dic.nsf/enwiki/78870"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1948, a northern plot was bought and later housed a liquor store, fire station, water tower, pump house, and equipment garages.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mapleview%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1954, the city purchased four acres along Murphy Creek, creating what is now Hillside Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mapleview%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Residents first received natural gas in 1962, modernizing the town’s utilities and improving daily life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
